itter.com/scythemarkx/status/1622135683451359234https://twitter.com/scythemarkx/status/1619141331527544832https://twitter.com/scythemarkx/status/1622137975130972160", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sutegoro4403/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea99815d/uploads/origins/310c1ee2-092c-4bc1-bb5c-93143ca4526b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e09b285651fc24d3648098f95e4af8ce", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ea99815d/uploads/origins/310c1ee2-092c-4bc1-bb5c-93143ca4526b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e09b285651fc24d3648098f95e4af8ce, https://si.imgix.net/ea99815d/uploads/origins/310c1ee2-092c-4bc1-bb5c-93143ca4526b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=507687e0cac095b331fd681ddd434636 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ea99815d/uploads/origins/310c1ee2-092c-4bc1-bb5c-93143ca4526b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cafc62663f9412f06ddf0ee4431639f0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、Yohane!私はあなたのアートスタイルがとても好きです\n\nエルフェルト・ヴァレンタインのファンアートをお願いしたいのですが、彼女のカラー3番のセクシーなポーズでお願いします。ポーズは自由です\n\nよろしくお願いします。\n\n参考カラー・デザイン： https://imgur.com/a/poyzxuM", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sutegoro4403/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2ab15be7/uploads/origins/a3604164-e1c9-4f8a-979a-51eddb9f7c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4300e2b0e51912eecd83a7351dff45ad", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2ab15be7/uploads/origins/a3604164-e1c9-4f8a-979a-51eddb9f7c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4300e2b0e51912eecd83a7351dff45ad, https://si.imgix.net/2ab15be7/uploads/origins/a3604164-e1c9-4f8a-979a-51eddb9f7c79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9c3542e4f24ea689f27abc024906239 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2ab15be7/uploads/or